    "contentHtml": "<article class=\"tw-status\"><header><strong>David Senra</strong></header><div class=\"tw-body\">杰夫·贝索斯给阿里·伊曼纽尔的建议：<br><br>“当你在场上时，就全身心投入场上。但记住，你不可能永远都在场上。必须有暂停、中场休息。你需要疗愈。恢复。演出当然必须继续，但比赛必须时不时停下来，让球员们喘口气。”</div><div class=\"tw-videos\"><a href=\"https://x.com/davidsenra/status/2107881382987121020\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107881146944286720/img/hPtpWJ_Sm0wHw9Hl.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a><a href=\"https://x.com/davidsenra/status/2107881382987121020\"><img src=\"https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107707804119433216/img/tRui8lCqoYxdLU0_.jpg\" alt=\"视频\" /></a></div><blockquote class=\"tw-quote\"><strong>@davidsenra</strong><p><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">我与 </span><span class=\"r-18u37iz\"><span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3 r-1wvb978\">@AriEmanuel</span></span><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"> 的对话。\n\n</span><span class=\"r-18u37iz\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">0:00</span></span></span><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"> 那场谈崩的 UFC 谈判\n</span><span class=\"r-18u37iz\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">3:33</span></span></span><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"> 结识埃贡·杜兰并收购 IMG\n</span><span class=\"r-18u37iz\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">7:30</span></span></span><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"> 押注 42 亿美元于 UFC\n</span><span class=\"r-18u37iz\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">15:16</span></span></span><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"> 敲定 ESPN 协议\n</span><span class=\"r-18u37iz\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">22:58</span></span></span><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"> 接管威廉·莫里斯\n</span><span class=\"r-18u37iz\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">30:02</span></span></span><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"> 用一张桌子和一部手机启动 Endeavor\n</span><span class=\"r-18u37iz\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\">32:53</span></span></span><span class=\"css-1jxf684 r-bcqeeo r-1ttztb7 r-qvutc0 r-poiln3\"> 为什么你</span></p><p><a class=\"tw-quote-link\" href=\"https://x.com/davidsenra/status/2107833330616213551\">引用推文原文</a></p></blockquote></article><hr/><h3>热门回复</h3><div class=\"tw-replies\"><div class=\"tw-reply\"><strong>@bobby</strong> <span class=\"tw-eng\">♥ 2 · 💬 2</span><p>不过，当时间线永不停歇时，很难有中场休息。</p></div><div class=\"tw-reply\"><strong>@Kamal Patel</strong> <span class=\"tw-eng\">♥ 0 · 💬 0</span><p>David，这期节目太棒了。等不及要读他的书了。</p></div></div>",
    "pageContent": "David Senra: 杰夫·贝索斯给阿里·伊曼纽尔的建议： “当你在场上时，就全身心投入场上。但记住，你不可能永远都在场上。必须有暂停、中场休息。你需要疗愈。恢复。演出当然必须继续，但比赛必须时不时停下来，让球员们喘口气。”\n[![视频](https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107881146944286720/img/hPtpWJ_Sm0wHw9Hl.jpg)](https://x.com/davidsenra/status/2107881382987121020)\n[![视频](https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2107707804119433216/img/tRui8lCqoYxdLU0_.jpg)](https://x.com/davidsenra/status/2107881382987121020)\n引用推文 (@davidsenra):\n我与 @AriEmanuel 的对话。 0:00 那场谈崩的 UFC 谈判\n3:33 结识埃贡·杜兰并收购 IMG\n7:30 押注 42 亿美元于 UFC\n15:16 敲定 ESPN 协议\n22:58 接管威廉·莫里斯\n30:02 用一张桌子和一部手机启动 Endeavor\n32:53 为什么你\n[引用推文原文](https://x.com/davidsenra/status/2107833330616213551)\n---\n热门回复 (共 2 条):\n@bobby (♥ 2 · 💬 2):\n不过，当时间线永不停歇时，很难有中场休息。\n\n@Kamal Patel (♥ 0 · 💬 0):\nDavid，这期节目太棒了。等不及要读他的书了。\n"
